  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 15 June 2025, the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted on 15 June 2025 and numbered HR PA 01 Rev A was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990.\r\n\r\nThe proposed works described in the application would constitute \"development\" for the purposes of Section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended), as they would involve a material change in the use of land and/or operational development. As such, the proposal would require express planning permission, and it cannot be considered lawful under section 191 or 192 of the Act."
